### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 【3-1 场景 1】正常创建：2 条明细，总额 1000.00
### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 期望：code=0，data=<新 id>
POST {{host}}/api/expense-forms
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "reason": "去南京出差",
  "items": [
    { "expenseDate": "2026-10-10", "amount": 320.00, "description": "高铁票" },
    { "expenseDate": "2026-10-11", "amount": 680.00, "description": "住宿2晚" }
  ]
}

### DB 核对（IDEA Database 控制台）：
###   SELECT id, form_no, applicant_id, dept_id, category_id,
###          total_amount, item_count, status
###   FROM expense_form ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1;
###   SELECT * FROM expense_item WHERE form_id = <上一步 id>;
###
### 必须对上三个数：
###   total_amount = 1000.00   ← 服务端 SUM，不是前端传的
###   item_count   = 2
###   dept_id      = 2         ← 张伟所在技术部，从员工表查的


